OL,3,GNEWSAProtester wears burqa to deny
OL,4,Aconcealing identity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA protestor has appeared in court
OL,7,Fwearing a burqa to deny a charge of
OL,8,Fwearing the Islamic religious garment
OL,9,Fto conceal his identity during a
OL,10,FHampshire protest.
OL,12,FTimothy Miller, 76, of Sherwood Avenue
OL,13,Fin Hedge End, Southampton, was arrested
OL,14,Fin relation to the anti-migrant and
OL,15,Fanti-racism demonstrations in
OL,16,FPortsmouth city centre on 12 September.
OL,18,FDuring the hearing at Portsmouth
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday, he
OL,20,Flifted the veil while holding a black
OL,21,Fhandbag as he confirmed his identity.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
